    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the silence of the end\"... that's an interesting way to put it. You say there's no shame in it. Do you really think it's a valid choice? To just... step away while the work is still whole, instead of waiting for the talent to fade and the irrelevance to set in?",
